    -ProjectCard<Me, Selecting>: SecurityFleet
    -ProjectCard<Me, Selecting>: Penguins
    -ProjectCard<Me, Selecting>: TowingAComet, AdaptationTechnology
    -ProjectCard<Me, Selecting>: Herbivores
